{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:13c83e2760bd2fd0f5c8bfd1c1f283bcc8e7298975ef132d665915093cdcd4e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc979155eae682cf8206a994a318868c1a91fd7e9ed95290cbd3c9d32678f28",
      "text": "打造“难以忘怀”生日的方法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2928955d9c03751c55dea9564fc9bc563e671293c9766c0080df1f433b59a92",
      "text": "幸广的生日马上就要到了。\n咲等人商量着今年办个怎样的派对。\n但是，幸广去年却忘记了自己的生日。\n既然这样，卷绪想出了一个绝妙的点子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000026:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000026:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc979155eae682cf8206a994a318868c1a91fd7e9ed95290cbd3c9d32678f28",
      "text": "打造“难以忘怀”生日的方法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6457d0a96e1dabbb7328fb501a3627a3dd1f4d17108ca56c7331d460bce5ad8f",
      "text": "马上就是神谷的生日了呢。\n今年要怎么办好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b21967ae0b6ffdd01b94af6e4ef601b33b4f35843f8f9469a9fb3ec67d735e1",
      "text": "吾之同胞于暗夜中呱呱坠地之尊贵吉日。\n当大开宴席！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:326bf8565ea67694ebbca23a97f4df542454f002a9ece2b3db31d81d22a321a6",
      "text": "是啊。\n难得一次，最好和去年不太一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007d534d077836ee6f9bba62eeb66f0ec63162c70d96f4cb58d2972ca608a53e",
      "text": "久等了，红茶和蛋糕准备好了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65c308200be4bf3d2d2fe891a5c42e2cbeeca71a53dcc4d49963fef748fff8c",
      "text": "呐，神谷！\n在自己的生日派对上，你有什么想做的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cf05eea8ee968a6cb1c95a0f8091ef94c6167d12f708c2c26ea0c814bbb5a7b",
      "text": "生日派对吗？\n嗯，让我想想……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4e003f417d9986aced42487f59acc80e01f9ae23ccdb0177c57080ff5aaf50",
      "text": "去年大家为我办的派对，\n我真的非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07699ea0d164c026568f0e5f5e58860b4189116a7cd65c0899f1e02d768944b1",
      "text": "那只是你的感想，算不上愿望吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c2a79d750d8cfe0ceaa14afd1f908e81fc8f48ab528bdf93bd455606a3dbef",
      "text": "……对自己生日的漠不关心，\n还是一如既往呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b43e2212fe15e68a808b23d228aedca34b30cdf442a42f5dd9bb1e7993838b5",
      "text": "哈哈，或许是吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201333eb9bc36d4e6c9c5ec36e1c0c9f35f47e49aedd06e3a028cb10db6b28ae",
      "text": "既然聊了这个话题，我觉得今年应该不会忘了吧……\n不过还是有点担心呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31742e2ddf92d21f38b1e24b07dd8d65785d337489942fb38303fba206db862c",
      "text": "作为去年忘得一干二净的人，我无言以对啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_a:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb3a52514e0516e5ff42a3be22fe55c9af624ddf03192127205ee0d9e289b209",
      "text": "啊！我想到了一个好办法！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a60b44752998be455a9f84333fd7e346ec4539ac0279064b717c47a67acece",
      "text": "观汝之神色……\n似乎是心生妙计了啊，卷绪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5779d3c7d16a7ea37bebca9bae74528bf3d749df2c184e9dc8a2fa98e75f7d3",
      "text": "是的！稍后再告诉大家。\n毕竟难得泡好的红茶都要凉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13493238a211ca236f7eb2b1b04ad1abebbccebb0c8628beb1ccb31224eec03e",
      "text": "神谷先生，请好好期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:604eed8262e6a4b73db7c86d054ead5d8adbeb41ef95794b352cbeb90ef79a21",
      "text": "呵呵，我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dbab54f72377d6648642fcae13ad9259978b748afddbd6bd262df4bfc418aff",
      "text": "那么，开始东云的新款蛋糕和\n红茶搭配的品鉴会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000121:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4aef5e7f8178cae14406e0d432d5c51048c780537ed16ebd3400aad996cd261",
      "text": "多谢款待！每一款都是充分发挥了双方优点的绝妙搭配！真不愧是神谷先生和庄一郎先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97cbd0fd46b453050816af376e708169dca24032a8fef95e6e92ae5f4b86d42",
      "text": "每一款都好好吃～。\n不管推出哪一种，客人们肯定都会超开心的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:265774db1ccb7996fe1b29c4a3ca358ce9ed06edeb8b2fd94a9cfdcddee2789d",
      "text": "唔姆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c39f0fb1477874d111201442666621897b77fd67427fdbbff1d01bac371376f",
      "text": "那么，我们一边收拾，\n一边召开秘密作战会议吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60789e9087cff722817a9a8d362c6154b083ff842431068c5ccef40e3c99825",
      "text": "神谷在此，\n好生委身于片刻的安宁便可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e99ae38e7b384644a3c7d8207e88a10e5443af7c51fb1b04f3aeb6dc166613",
      "text": "啪噼地好好期待着吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df44150d69bd6ac3ff32d5099ac5aaaece3bd55fabb0d8e21be9432c61ebd4da",
      "text": "好的，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8822c01990a315540ce6abd6d2dd92b09840fbacd26fb7c6a0167bc4f17970d",
      "text": "光是大家“为了我”这份心意，\n不管是什么样的派对我都已经很高兴了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03b5f0919a1d7af48acbf858b211915e75e2385e08d536270e7c7aea1849661c",
      "text": "神谷先生，请收下这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a3355ade552f7d0561f0a8142d996095e38c6ef211439f0a40c1b8687221d0",
      "text": "这是……降临历？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:035d77fbafa2f4e51155f2522f4534c09d90aac15a809b81314b656cd538af89",
      "text": "是的。为了不让神谷先生忘记生日，\n大家一起准备的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c5164383f944cbc398f3c9bfe1a1b0374c57a96d5d3142adfcc2be56a94d5a0",
      "text": "本来是用来给圣诞节当天倒计时的东西，\n但我们改造成了生日专用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb9e65044f6aa1e61aeb477a8fbc88682ef1ed900ca3a68f364de826ade334b",
      "text": "不仅是同胞，连吾主也一同炼成的\n至高无上的一品！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a20434a6efc044a8491ce58092c9634c91443fb1d0dfc18acea68cd81fef51c",
      "text": "特意为我准备了这个吗。\n大家，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f36eb7b9907ddd3756f0faaa65bb8d76a105e2eaaa28365aa3f4713fe7f9fc",
      "text": "像这样，每一天都啪噼地\n进行倒计时的话，绝对就不会忘了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6444e8de3ab01235e900a7ee300d0fdb02addd92de8052ee21cfb2f382c8a544",
      "text": "到生日前一天为止，\n每天早上都要打开一个哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000153:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f9bd269805295658eaa5627976cd61b6eb3a713f6e431de9e60f706b8c618f",
      "text": "……这样就，好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b846fad65cf38490682c286052dc6f2464de4449da13a7b04d1f0a96eba1e5d8",
      "text": "不过话说回来，做得真好啊。\n能充分感受到大家的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_c:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da9d171ad5e59e657cc4a5eaf7446b36511360e2d25ddfaa428f99e1c899e8c8",
      "text": "明天开始，真期待去打开它啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e7d88fcb683726c7d1d7c981689cdd0b72dcdf6cd5c406a21e872a5104c581",
      "text": "好了，今天里面装了什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ae33da0b65f38f9b799b5b2e76343ca4320104e570d0807b26574c281f711d",
      "text": "今天是……香草茶吗。\n还附带了大家的留言呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c315e4a575591680e305c111192672d71f88daa7d1d842b2ef5e804acfc1db9",
      "text": "“早上好。昨晚睡得好吗？”\n“一同迈向砥砺钻研之岁月！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b44cb206e9faaf5240f3c3f404141e31747860fbea324fbb3b8a5b8d3edb9e6f",
      "text": "“今天想过成怎样的一天呢？”\n“要过成啪噼快乐的一天哦☆”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6cb7f7227e16650ae0c860de5879d7541309f1ac8a6829d29be37048e55e82f",
      "text": "“已经到周中了。稍微喘口气，继续加油吧”\n……这是●●●●プロデューサー写来的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1b80e5762b2a0af00fab2bd0609c182659084833cfada27b8254d6dc37bc678",
      "text": "昨天是巧克力，\n前天是糖果来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a236c8b0b6cd2915b68c76af1ea940b81c6b941e35cef59bdc120d61d3bc70c1",
      "text": "（每天早晨，随着一格格打开降临历，\n心情都会变得更加期待自己的生日）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dafe599054c2399b12e66dd40ff8ac39b80ec6a4e06e192d400a7dec8e518847",
      "text": "（这也是，多亏了大家啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb183fd56a47b514f29bcebf93cb114bd810c2d7b9c3eb4582132f0651ced7ec",
      "text": "好，喝完这杯香草茶，\n今天一天也要加油啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14aa353862a559339235870196d26ff1414421474374eb95b50ffdb5c34a87be",
      "text": "生日前夜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da2f7c5f97591b40db40c8f4eba82ec2599b051c930e00e9fe105ec591b32c1f",
      "text": "（……好，过零点了。\n来打开今天的降临历吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e11fc6baaeadb70c8007d01b74d50dfc0ce45fcf39958f077d4b735b345038e",
      "text": "（我记得他们说过，在生日前一天为止，\n都要在早晨打开来着……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa7db56299da3be060826b8be7186dcd71dc910a7be2ab395f9dfcd6862fe19f",
      "text": "哈哈，被看穿我的行动了啊。\n那么，今天的是什么呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84a18fe130b180e85ce5e0c1be2ec32dd33acfc96d7cb79ed850147987c3556f",
      "text": "留言是“生日快乐！”吗。\n大家，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0b1b180e95eed7d06d3f67acd25ab6864a603f711307a6a3e4e80d5283f5ebe",
      "text": "嗯？这个二维码是……让我扫码访问的意思吗。\n我看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da456d601f399002a61941d5e3bb05a6517b5fbbc92d54932f477e408f66b47e",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000122:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da456d601f399002a61941d5e3bb05a6517b5fbbc92d54932f477e408f66b47e",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000122:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabfb945b7eb4794b25ece07f2536f5aa2d9a6dcb5dc838f1dc63a9c798607e0",
      "text": "大家，还有\n●●●●プロデューサー也是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c4d9239f6febc7699e91cdab7732347a360874696d5735afb3abd7cbbc683f",
      "text": "我和神谷认识也很久了呢。\n祝愿今年也会是硕果累累的一年。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b708eb5254c575ba87f00abf99b8995e85d45eadb02051041565a2df1bd2c99f",
      "text": "要度过Happy Pappy的一年哦！\n一起把每一天都过得笑脸满～满吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f39ef088a91785bdd84092b6f6cb1cb66b7e5be302e18a1aea68da842ce92f3e",
      "text": "愿接下来的这一年，\n对神谷先生而言会是美好的每一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51e0f427bf05ef82b53567bf93d2e531ce06cfb7b24c4fdeaf5d251874a808a0",
      "text": "愿汝之霸道光辉灿烂！\n想必诸多光之子民亦在如此祈祷吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000210:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb3611f85a5a840f1ed3d88f7181d62d31a553707ac939e9340d45b70ea7734",
      "text": "今后也请让我继续支持幸广先生，\n希望您能有更多的活跃表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000221:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3065277b5c90a79f31859481875f534c32895d3b530861be0d66f1d78d94dd4",
      "text": "今天下午会在Cafe Parade举办生日派对。\n请务必光临。我们恭候您的大驾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000243:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a04bd34701d7299e6f6caccff95fdacedaafd8cd273dc04c0ddfcfead62b17bc",
      "text": "……真让人开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_e:cmd-000251:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e95ca5e21366940d3a77c0f709de4ada1ab321d67427297832ecd8935cd7da5b",
      "text": "多亏了大家，\n今天似乎会成为非常美好的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
